{
  "bridge_text": "在寒冷的冬夜里，莉娜紧了紧红色的羊毛大衣，那棵发出低吟的古树就在不远处等着她。既然你想听中文，那我们就顺着莉娜的脚步，走进这个奇妙的秘密。",
  "resume_strategy": "continue",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "在这个羊毛灰色的村庄边缘，那棵比教堂还要高的空心树正静静伫立。每当冬夜降临，树皮里便会飘出阵阵低吟。大人们总是告诫孩子们不要靠近，但那天晚上，当奶奶没讲完故事就沉沉睡去，莉娜独自穿过结霜的田野，想要亲自去听听那树里的秘密。"
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s1"
}

{
  "bridge_text": "The secret of Mosk's grumpiness hides in the shadows of the tree, waiting for us to uncover it. We find Lina still standing on that top step, apple in hand.",
  "resume_strategy": "continue",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "Lina stood firm, her eyes meeting the fox's weary gaze. She knew the humming was a mystery that had to be solved, and she wasn't going to turn back just because the path was forbidden. Mosk didn't budge, his ears twitching as he watched her, waiting to see if she would truly leave the hollow tree behind."
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s2"
}

{
  "bridge_text": "With Mosk settled on his step in his patched green vest, Lina looked past him, wondering what secrets lay further down the winding tree stairs.",
  "resume_strategy": "skip",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Mosk pointed at the door, his gaze sharp and unyielding. Lina reached into her pocket and pulled out the last apple of the season. She set it on the step between them and said, this is for the trouble of walking me down. Mosk stared at the apple for a long time. Then he stood up, tied his vest, and stepped onto the first stair without a word."
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "text": "At the bottom of the stairs the humming was a quiet song, and a firefly the size of a robin lay on a bed of moss. Her glow was almost out. Mosk's whiskers trembled. She had been his friend once, he whispered, and one winter long ago he had failed to bring her medicine in time. He had been guarding the tree ever since, ashamed to face her."
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s3"
}

{
