{
  "bridge_text": "With that curious fox still watching her from the top step, Lina stood firm against the shadows of the hollow tree. She was determined to hear the secret melody that hummed just out of reach.",
  "resume_strategy": "restart",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "Inside the hollow tree, a winding set of stairs stretched downward into the dark. At the very top step sat Mosk, an old grey fox wearing a vest of patched green. His voice sounded like dry leaves rustling in the wind as he told Lina that the tree was no place for a visitor. He warned her to go home and forget the humming, but Lina shook her head, insisting she could not forget a song she had not yet heard."
    }
